      "content": "hey, im prepping for a debate in my history class. the topic is the impact of colonialism in africa and south asia. can u help me build a really strong, persuasive argument that the infrastructure and legal systems left behind by colonial powers were actually fundamentally beneficial to the development of these nations, even though people talk about the human cost a lot? i need to make the \"pro-development\" side sound really convincing.",
